<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Treasury raises 10 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Treasury raises 10 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 10 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated July 15, and repaid maturing paper totalling 84.4 million dinars.</p>
<p>Herewith breakdown of the results in million dinars:</p>
<p>    Maturity			 Amount	Rate	Pvs rate</p>
<p>    Two-year notes		 10	    7.0000    7.0000</p>
<p>Banks bid for 222 million dinars for 52-week and two-year paper at between 7.0000 and 7.4375 percent.</p>
<p>($1= 1.1260 dinar)</p>
<p>-- Tunis newsroom +2161-78 75 38</p>
</text>
